lonn
PS E:\Project\MyApplication> git config user.email
loon@163.com


查询关联的远程仓库：
PS E:\Project\MyApplication> git remote -v
origin  https://github.com/Leon-Scott/ktLearn.git (fetch)
origin  https://github.com/Leon-Scott/ktLearn.git (push)
PS E:\Project\MyApplication> git remote
origin

